# Bosch's closed-source BMV080 SDK, vendored into the SparkFun wrapper in
# lib/. SparkFun themselves cannot redistribute these, which is why the public
# repo ships only README placeholders. Excluded here on the same reasoning -
# check Bosch's license before deciding to commit them. See README.md
# ("The BMV080 needs Bosch's SDK") for how to restore them.
